---
// TestimonialsHeader.astro
---

<section class="relative bg-white pt-28 pb-16 px-6 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle Background Gradient Glow -->
  <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 -translate-x-1/2 h-96 w-[800px] rounded-full bg-[#FDF9F7] blur-[120px] pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl flex flex-col items-center text-center animate-fade-in-up">
    
    <!-- Subtitle / Eyebrow -->
    <span class="font-sans text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.35em] text-[#B02317] uppercase mb-6">
      Testimonials
    </span>

    <!-- Main Heading -->
    <h2 class="font-serif text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-medium text-[#121417] tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">
      Voices of <span class="italic text-[#B02317]">Trust</span>
    </h2>

    <!-- Description Paragraph -->
    <p class="font-sans text-lg sm:text-xl text-[#88726F] mt-8 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-light">
      We don't just build structures; we curate lifestyles. Hear from the visionaries and families who have chosen to build their legacy with Udbhav Developers.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>